From: slwyts <slwyts@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: ci: build the Piano device tree

Carry the native device-tree build workflow from linux-piano.

The port retains changes from these linux-piano commits:
ci: cache arm64 kernel builds with ccache (#5) (bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>)

Co-authored-by: bluseliu50 <265648257+bluseliu50@users.noreply.github.com>

Link: https://github.com/blu-sharky/linux-piano/commit/7b43ed320b16dc139446a1d79c8e7793d8cdb521
Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/e8fcf33971263f28085dbc0dbe5039438bf76c13
---
 .github/workflows/piano-dtb.yml | 58 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 58 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .github/workflows/piano-dtb.yml

diff --git a/.github/workflows/piano-dtb.yml b/.github/workflows/piano-dtb.yml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..d2f092d8fb44c1b18c680850dbaed201a7030ef2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.github/workflows/piano-dtb.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,58 @@
+name: piano-dtb
+
+on:
+  pull_request:
+  push:
+    branches: ['piano-*']
+
+permissions:
+  contents: read
+
+jobs:
+  piano-dtb:
+    name: piano-dtb
+    runs-on: ubuntu-24.04-arm
+    steps:
+      - uses: actions/checkout@v5
+
+      - name: Install toolchain
+        run: |
+          sudo apt-get update
+          sudo apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
+              ccache \
+              clang lld llvm bc flex bison libssl-dev libelf-dev cpio \
+              dwarves device-tree-compiler
+
+      # Rolling compiler cache: every run saves a fresh entry (run_id key),
+      # restore falls back to the most recent one. First run is cold.
+      - name: Restore ccache
+        uses: actions/cache@v4
+        with:
+          path: ~/.cache/ccache
+          key: ccache-${{ runner.arch }}-${{ github.run_id }}
+          restore-keys: ccache-${{ runner.arch }}-
+
+      - name: Build piano_defconfig, Image and dtbs
+        env:
+          # Runner image clang updates must invalidate, not mis-hit
+          CCACHE_COMPILERCHECK: content
+        run: |
+          ccache --zero-stats
+          make ARCH=arm64 LLVM=1 CC="ccache clang" O=out piano_defconfig
+          make ARCH=arm64 LLVM=1 CC="ccache clang" O=out -j"$(nproc)" Image dtbs
+          ccache --show-stats
+
+      - name: Verify piano artifacts
+        run: |
+          test -s out/arch/arm64/boot/Image
+          test -s out/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-xiaomi-piano.dtb
+
+      - name: Upload artifacts
+        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
+        with:
+          name: piano-build
+          path: |
+            out/arch/arm64/boot/Image
+            out/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8750-xiaomi-piano.dtb
+          retention-days: 7
+          if-no-files-found: error
